        `},{id:20,title:"The 'MRV Expiration' Alert: Why 2026 is the Hard Deadline for Many",image:"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543269865-cbf427effbad?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80",date:"Feb 14, 2026",author:"Shahab Ali",category:"Urgent Alert",excerpt:"Your visa fee isn't valid forever. If you paid in 2024 or 2025, your window to book an interview is closing fast. Don't lose $185.",content:`
